{
  "Combat.Terra.MeteorShower.Name": "Meteor Shower",
  "Combat.Terra.MeteorShower.Description": "Combo: Stone Knives + Scorch. Launch a barrage of flaming stones at all enemies, grounding and dealing heavier damage to flying targets.",
  "Combat.Terra.MeteorShower.Intro": "You slam your body into the flame-stricken earth, sinking your arms into it. With true confluence of earth and fire, you tear through and send hundreds of burning stones flying up into the sky.",
